{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04371","headline":"夜集张諲所居 · 刘希夷","name":"夜集张諲所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南成久客，门馆日萧条。\n惟有图书在，多伤鬓髪凋。\n诸生陪讲诵，稚子给渔樵。\n隐室寒灯净，空阶落叶飘。\n沧洲自有趣，谁道隐须招。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}